{
"#name"
:
{
"free"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"显示内存使用情况"
,
"en"
:
"Display memory usage"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以清晰的层次结构显示内存使用情况。\n支持 macOS（带内存压缩信息）和 Linux。\n默认以人类可读格式显示（GiB/MiB）。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Display memory usage in clear hierarchical format.\nSupports macOS (with compression info) and Linux.\nDefault to human-readable format (GiB/MiB).\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"【Linux 内存计算模型】\n\n各列含义：\n  total     : 总物理内存\n  used      : 已使用内存 (total - free - buff/cache)\n  free      : 完全空闲内存\n  shared    : tmpfs 等共享内存（已包含在 used 中）\n  buff/cache: 缓存和缓冲区 (可被回收)\n  available : 可用内存 (≈ free + 可回收的 buff/cache)\n\n恒等式：\n  total = used + free + buff/cache\n  \n说明：\n  - shared 是 used 的子集（tmpfs 占用的内存）\n  - used 包含：应用程序 + shared + 内核数据（不含 buff/cache）\n  - available 是内核估算值，通常小于 free + buff/cache\n    因为部分缓存是活跃文件页，不能立即丢弃。\n"
,
"en"
:
"【Linux Memory Model】\n\nColumn meanings:\n  total     : Total physical memory\n  used      : Used memory (total - free - buff/cache)\n  free      : Completely free memory\n  shared    : Shared memory (tmpfs, etc.) - included in used\n  buff/cache: Cache and buffers (reclaimable)\n  available : Available memory (≈ free + reclaimable buff/cache)\n\nIdentity:\n  total = used + free + buff/cache\n  \nNotes:\n  - shared is a subset of used (tmpfs memory)\n  - used contains: applications + shared + kernel data (excluding buff/cache)\n  - available is kernel's estimate, usually less than free + buff/cache\n    because some cache is active file pages that cannot be dropped immediately.\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"【macOS 内存模型】\n\nDetail 字段，以及与 vm_stat 映射:\n  wired      : 内核保留内存 (= Pages wired down)\n               包含内核代码、驱动、关键数据结构\n               以及被 mlock() 锁定的用户内存\n               这部分内存不能被交换或压缩\n  compressed : 已压缩数据占用 (= Pages occupied by compressor)\n  app        : 应用工作集 (= Anonymous pages - Pages purgeable)\n  purgeable  : 应用标记的可清除缓存 (= Pages purgeable)\n  cache      : 文件缓存 (= File-backed pages)\n  available  : 立即可分配 (= speculative + throttled + free)\n\n恒等式：\n  total ≈ used + reusable\n\n  total ≈ wired + compressed + app + purgeable + cache + available\n  available = free + spec + throt\n  active + inactive == app + purgeable + cache\n\n  total ≈ wired + compressed + active + inactive + free + spec + throt\n\nwired (Pages wired down) 详解:\n  - 被内核\"钉住\"的内存页，不能被交换到磁盘\n  - 不能被内存压缩器压缩\n  - 主要包括：内核代码、驱动程序、内核栈、部分 DMA 缓冲区\n  - 少数情况下包含用户态通过 mlock() 锁定的内存\n  - 系统内存压力时，wired 是唯一完全不可回收的部分\n\n---\nvm_stat 原始计数器映射：\n  wired      ← Pages wired down (内核保留内存)\n  compressed ← Pages occupied by compressor (压缩器占用)\n  app        ← Anonymous pages - Pages purgeable (匿名页-可清除)\n  purgeable  ← Pages purgeable (可清除缓存)\n  cache      ← File-backed pages (文件缓存)\n  available  ← Pages speculative + Pages throttled + Pages free\n"
,
"en"
:
"【macOS Memory Model】\n\nDetail fields and vm_stat mapping:\n  wired      : Kernel reserved memory (= Pages wired down)\n               Includes kernel code, drivers, critical data structures\n               and user memory locked via mlock()\n               This memory cannot be swapped or compressed\n  compressed : Compressed data size (= Pages occupied by compressor)\n  app        : Application working set (= Anonymous pages - Pages purgeable)\n  purgeable  : App-marked reclaimable cache (= Pages purgeable)\n  cache      : File cache (= File-backed pages)\n  available  : Immediately allocatable (= speculative + throttled + free)\n\nIdentities:\n  total ≈ used + reusable\n\n  total ≈ wired + compressed + app + purgeable + cache + available\n  available = free + spec + throt\n  active + inactive == app + purgeable + cache\n\n  total ≈ wired + compressed + active + inactive + free + spec + throt\n\nwired (Pages wired down) explained:\n  - Memory pages \"pinned\" by the kernel, cannot be swapped to disk\n  - Cannot be compressed by the memory compressor\n  - Mainly includes: kernel code, drivers, kernel stacks, some DMA buffers\n  - May include user-space memory locked via mlock()\n  - Under memory pressure, wired is the only completely non-reclaimable part\n\n---\nvm_stat raw counters mapping:\n  wired      ← Pages wired down (kernel reserved memory)\n  compressed ← Pages occupied by compressor (compressor overhead)\n  app        ← Anonymous pages - Pages purgeable (anonymous - purgeable)\n  purgeable  ← Pages purgeable (reclaimable cache)\n  cache      ← File-backed pages (file cache)\n  available  ← Pages speculative + Pages throttled + Pages free\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x free"
,
"cn"
:
"显示内存使用情况（人类可读格式）"
,
"en"
:
"Display memory usage (human-readable)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x free --csv"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式输出（单行，适合处理）"
,
"en"
:
"Output in CSV format (single line, for processing)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x free --tsv --no-header"
,
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式输出，无表头"
,
"en"
:
"Output in TSV format without header"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x free -s 2"
,
"cn"
:
"每 2 秒刷新一次"
,
"en"
:
"Refresh every 2 seconds"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x free -s 1 -c 10"
,
"cn"
:
"每秒刷新，共 10 次"
,
"en"
:
"Refresh every second, 10 times"
}
]
,
"run|--"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示内存使用情况"
,
"en"
:
"Display memory usage"
}
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式输出（扁平单行）"
,
"en"
:
"Output in CSV format (flat, single line)"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式输出（扁平单行）"
,
"en"
:
"Output in TSV format (flat, single line)"
}
}
,
"--no-header"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"CSV/TSV 输出中不显示表头"
,
"en"
:
"Suppress header in CSV/TSV output"
}
}
,
"-s|--seconds"
:
{
"#arg"
:
"N"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"每 N 秒重复打印"
,
"en"
:
"Repeat printing every N seconds"
}
}
,
"-c|--count"
:
{
"#arg"
:
"N"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"重复打印 N 次后退出"
,
"en"
:
"Repeat printing N times, then exit"
}
}
,
"-h|--help"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示帮助信息"
,
"en"
:
"Show help information"
}
}
}

